  "decision_summary": "Predicted high (F>=20%) with high confidence. The query is a pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine JAK inhibitor closely related to baricitinib (~80%, C09) and ruxolitinib (>95%/74%, C17/C18/C21); sulfonamide-containing comparators also exceed 20% (C03/C13/C05/C01/C02). L3 oral exposure records for related JAK inhibitors show measurable systemic exposure and no affirmative evidence for F<20%. Direct query-specific F remains unavailable."
}

